  "translation": "Gomme Elisha a re: Yahwe Tsebaote o a phela, yo ke emago pele ga gage — gobane e sego ka baka la sefahlogo sa Yehoshafata, kgoši ya Yehuda, nka be ga ke lebadile go wena, gomme ga ke ka ke a go bona.",
